---
---

<section class="py-24 px-4 bg-slate-50 relative overflow-hidden border-t border-b border-slate-100">
  {/* Orange glow behind */}
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-brand-orange/5 rounded-full blur-[120px] pointer-events-none -z-10"></div>

  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto relative z-10">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      
      {/* Esquerda: Informações do Certificado */}
      <div class="space-y-6 text-left reveal-up active">
        <span class="text-brand-orange font-black text-sm uppercase tracking-wider italic">Garantía de Calidad</span>
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-tighter italic leading-none">
          CURSO CON <br /> <span class="text-brand-orange">CERTIFICADO RECONOCIDO</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold leading-relaxed">
          Tan pronto como completes las clases puedes descargar el Certificado Oficial del Curso.
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          El certificado oficial de **NTR Escuela de Motores** comprueba que has superado la capacitación en Relación de Compresión, dominando los cálculos, ajustes y límites de preparación segura en la práctica.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Direita: Certificado Estilizado em CSS Light Premium */}
      <div class="flex justify-center items-center reveal-up active">
        <div class="relative w-full max-w-lg bg-white rounded-[24px] p-8 border-4 border-slate-200 shadow-[0_15px_45px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] flex flex-col items-center justify-between text-center select-none overflow-hidden aspect-[1.4/1]">
          {/* Efeitos de Linhas no Certificado */}
          <div class="absolute inset-4 border border-brand-orange/10 pointer-events-none rounded-[16px]"></div>
          <div class="absolute inset-6 border-2 border-brand-orange/5 pointer-events-none rounded-[14px]"></div>

          {/* Cabeçalho do Certificado */}
          <div class="space-y-1 relative z-10 pt-4">
            <span class="text-[9px] text-brand-orange font-black uppercase tracking-[0.3em]">Certificado de Formación</span>
            <h4 class="text-slate-800 font-black text-2xl uppercase tracking-widest italic leading-none">NTR ESCUELA DE MOTORES</h4>
            <div class="w-12 h-[2px] bg-brand-orange mx-auto mt-2"></div>
          </div>

          {/* Corpo do Certificado */}
          <div class="space-y-2 relative z-10 py-6">
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 italic">Certificamos que el alumno ha concluido con éxito la capacitación de</p>
            <p class="text-brand-orange font-black text-xl md:text-2xl uppercase tracking-tight italic leading-none">Tasa de Compresión & Preparación</p>
            <p class="text-[9px] text-slate-400">Método práctico sin riesgo de rotura para motores de 4 tiempos.</p>
          </div>

          {/* Rodapé do Certificado */}
          <div class="w-full flex justify-between items-end relative z-10 px-4 pb-4">
            <div class="text-left">
              <div class="w-24 h-[1px] bg-slate-300 mb-1"></div>
              <p class="text-[8px] text-slate-600 font-bold">Fábio Scaravonatto</p>
              <p class="text-[7px] text-slate-400 uppercase">Instructor / Preparador</p>
            </div>
            
            {/* Selo Laranja */}
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full border-2 border-brand-orange bg-orange-50 flex items-center justify-center relative shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(255,90,0,0.15)]">
              <span class="text-[8px] text-brand-orange font-black tracking-widest uppercase">NTR</span>
              <div class="absolute -bottom-1 -right-1 w-2.5 h-6 bg-brand-orange/20 rotate-12 -z-10 origin-top"></div>
              <div class="absolute -bottom-1 -left-1 w-2.5 h-6 bg-brand-orange/20 -rotate-12 -z-10 origin-top"></div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="text-right">
              <div class="w-24 h-[1px] bg-slate-300 mb-1"></div>
              <p class="text-[8px] text-slate-600 font-bold">Autenticidad</p>
              <p class="text-[7px] text-slate-400 uppercase">Registro Oficial NTR</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
